@startuml

title Smart Museum Artifact Conservation System

[*] --> STARTUP

STARTUP : Perform startup checks
STARTUP --> MONITORING : Sensors and control devices verified

STARTUP --> SAFE_SHUTDOWN : Required component failure

MONITORING : Monitor artifact and environment

MONITORING --> MONITORING : Artifact placed / identification recorded
MONITORING --> MONITORING : Load environmental profile

MONITORING --> CONSERVATION_ACTIVE : Door closed and profile loaded

CONSERVATION_ACTIVE : Normal conservation operation

CONSERVATION_ACTIVE --> MONITORING : Door opened

MONITORING --> CONSERVATION_ACTIVE : Door closed and conditions verified

CONSERVATION_ACTIVE --> TEMP_CORRECTION : Temperature outside range

TEMP_CORRECTION : Issue temperature correction

TEMP_CORRECTION --> ENVIRONMENT_VERIFICATION : Correction issued

ENVIRONMENT_VERIFICATION : Verify sensor readings

ENVIRONMENT_VERIFICATION --> CONSERVATION_ACTIVE : Condition restored

ENVIRONMENT_VERIFICATION --> PROTECTION_MODE : Recovery period exceeded

PROTECTION_MODE : Protect artifact
PROTECTION_MODE : Reduce light
PROTECTION_MODE : Activate additional controls
PROTECTION_MODE : Alert operator

PROTECTION_MODE --> MONITORING : Conditions verified

CONSERVATION_ACTIVE --> VIBRATION_RESPONSE : Significant vibration

VIBRATION_RESPONSE : Suspend risky activities
VIBRATION_RESPONSE : Monitor vibration

VIBRATION_RESPONSE --> VIBRATION_STABILIZATION : Vibration below threshold

VIBRATION_STABILIZATION : Verify required stabilization period

VIBRATION_STABILIZATION --> CONSERVATION_ACTIVE : Stabilization confirmed

VIBRATION_STABILIZATION --> VIBRATION_RESPONSE : Threshold exceeded again

CONSERVATION_ACTIVE --> EMERGENCY_POWER : Primary power lost
MONITORING --> EMERGENCY_POWER : Primary power lost
PROTECTION_MODE --> EMERGENCY_POWER : Primary power lost
VIBRATION_RESPONSE --> EMERGENCY_POWER : Primary power lost

EMERGENCY_POWER : Check emergency power availability

EMERGENCY_POWER --> MONITORING : Emergency power available
EMERGENCY_POWER --> SAFE_SHUTDOWN : Emergency power unavailable

SAFE_SHUTDOWN : Record incident
SAFE_SHUTDOWN : Stop non-essential activities
SAFE_SHUTDOWN : Preserve system information

SAFE_SHUTDOWN --> [*]

@enduml
